{
  "$comment": "Stop reason contract (context pipeline §8.6, D-12). Clients map each protocol family's terminal signal to the persisted stopReason enum with their production parsers. Sources: OpenAI chat finish_reason / Responses status+incomplete_details.reason (platform.openai.com API reference); Anthropic stop_reason (platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/handling-stop-reasons, 7 values incl. model_context_window_exceeded); Gemini Candidate.FinishReason (ai.google.dev/api/generate-content, read 2026-10-15). Gemini Interactions status (ai.google.dev/api/interactions-api, read 2026-10-18); Gemini PromptFeedback.BlockReason (ai.google.dev/api/generate-content, read 2026-10-18); llama.cpp server stop_type (github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp tools/server/README.md + server-task.h enum stop_type, read 2026-10-18).",
  "schema": "oriveo.context.stop-reason",
  "version": 1,
  "enum": [
    "stop",
    "length",
    "content_filter",
    "tool",
    "context_window_exceeded",
    "interrupted",
    "incomplete",
    "error",
    "unknown"
  ],
  "ended": {
    "clean": "the family's terminal marker was seen: OpenAI chat [DONE] or a non-null finish_reason; Responses response.completed / response.incomplete / response.failed; Anthropic message_stop; Gemini a candidate finishReason; managed message.completed; Free [DONE]",
    "eof_without_marker": "the byte stream ended before the terminal marker",
    "error_frame": "an in-stream error frame ended the answer (Free free_stream_incomplete, managed request.error)",
    "transport_error": "the connection failed",
    "user_cancelled": "the user pressed stop"
  },
  "mapping": {
    "openai_chat": {
      "stop": "stop",
      "length": "length",
      "content_filter": "content_filter",
      "tool_calls": "tool",
      "function_call": "tool"
    },
    "openai_responses": {
      "completed": "stop",
      "incomplete:max_output_tokens": "length",
      "incomplete:content_filter": "content_filter",
      "failed": "error"
    },
    "anthropic": {
      "end_turn": "stop",
      "stop_sequence": "stop",
      "max_tokens": "length",
      "tool_use": "tool",
      "pause_turn": "incomplete",
      "refusal": "content_filter",
      "model_context_window_exceeded": "context_window_exceeded"
    },
    "gemini": {
      "STOP": "stop",
      "MAX_TOKENS": "length",
      "SAFETY": "content_filter",
      "RECITATION": "content_filter",
      "BLOCKLIST": "content_filter",
      "PROHIBITED_CONTENT": "content_filter",
      "SPII": "content_filter",
      "IMAGE_SAFETY": "content_filter",
      "IMAGE_PROHIBITED_CONTENT": "content_filter",
      "IMAGE_RECITATION": "content_filter",
      "LANGUAGE": "content_filter",
      "ESCALATION": "content_filter",
      "PUP_LIMITED_DISABLED": "content_filter",
      "CONTINUATION": "length",
      "MALFORMED_FUNCTION_CALL": "error",
      "MALFORMED_RESPONSE": "error",
      "MISSING_THOUGHT_SIGNATURE": "error",
      "UNEXPECTED_TOOL_CALL": "error",
      "TOO_MANY_TOOL_CALLS": "error",
      "OTHER": "unknown",
      "FINISH_REASON_UNSPECIFIED": "unknown",
      "IMAGE_OTHER": "unknown",
      "NO_IMAGE": "unknown"
    },
    "managed": {
      "stop": "stop",
      "length": "length",
      "content_filter": "content_filter",
      "tool": "tool",
      "context_window_exceeded": "context_window_exceeded",
      "incomplete": "incomplete",
      "error": "error",
      "unknown": "unknown"
    },
    "free": {
      "stop": "stop",
      "length": "length",
      "content_filter": "content_filter",
      "tool_calls": "tool"
    },
    "gemini_interactions": {
      "completed": "stop",
      "incomplete": "length",
      "requires_action": "tool",
      "failed": "error"
    },
    "llama_cpp": {
      "eos": "stop",
      "word": "stop",
      "limit": "length"
    }
  },
  "rules": [
    "user_cancelled -> interrupted.",
    "transport_error / error_frame -> incomplete when any answer text arrived, else error.",
    "eof_without_marker -> incomplete, even when a finish value was seen earlier.",
    "clean -> mapping[family][finishRaw]; null or unmapped finishRaw -> unknown.",
    "Responses finishRaw is status, or 'incomplete:' + incomplete_details.reason; an unmapped incomplete:* reason -> incomplete.",
    "Gemini Interactions (family gemini_interactions) finishRaw = the interaction status of the terminal event (interaction.completed / the final interaction object); in_progress / queued are not terminal and cancelled is left unmapped (unknown). The Interactions API has no promptFeedback.",
    "Gemini generateContent prompt block (promptFeedback.blockReason set and no candidate): family gemini, ended clean, finishRaw = 'blockReason:' + blockReason; any blockReason:* -> content_filter except blockReason:BLOCK_REASON_UNSPECIFIED -> unknown. These keys are resolved by this rule, not by mapping.gemini.",
    "llama.cpp native /completion (family llama_cpp): the final chunk (stop: true) ends clean with finishRaw = stop_type; servers older than stop_type (b4000-era) set it from stopped_eos -> eos, stopped_word -> word, stopped_limit -> limit, else none. none is unmapped (unknown). A stream that closes before a stop: true chunk is eof_without_marker."
  ],
  "ui": {
    "length": {
      "notice": "incomplete_output_limit",
      "continueAction": true
    },
    "incomplete": {
      "notice": "incomplete_connection",
      "continueAction": true
    },
    "content_filter": {
      "notice": "filtered",
      "continueAction": false
    },
    "context_window_exceeded": {
      "notice": "context_overflow",
      "continueAction": false
    },
    "stop": null,
    "tool": null,
    "interrupted": null,
    "error": null,
    "unknown": null
  },
